Gio Bernard breaks free and runs 89 yards. Bengals 14–7."}, {"start": 12.89, "end": 16.45, "step": 89, "text": "Then Andy Dalton starts throwing the game away."}, {"start": 20.3, "end": 23.86, "step": 106, "text": "Carolina pounces. Cam Newton powers in. Panthers 24–17."}, {"start": 26.23, "end": 30.35, "step": 131, "text": "Fourth quarter. Dalton goes deep to Sanu. 24–24. Now it's war."}, {"start": 30.5, "end": 33.37, "step": 149, "text": "Panthers go up 31–24. Pacman Jones answers..."}, {"start": 33.52, "end": 37.42, "step": 150, "text": "...97 yards. Bengals tie it, 31–31. Back from the dead."}, {"start": 37.57, "end": 41.45, "step": 161, "text": "Nugent kicks Cincinnati ahead, 34–31. Surely that's the end."}, {"start": 41.71, "end": 46.51, "step": 177, "text": "Five seconds left. Gano from 44 ties it. 34–34. Neither team will die."}, {"start": 46.66, "end": 50.54, "step": 208, "text": "Overtime. A field goal each. 37–37. Still nobody falls."}, {"start": 51.46, "end": 54.34, "step": 219, "text": "Two seconds. Nugent from 36, to end it..."}, {"start": 54.49, "end": 57.73, "step": 219, "text": "Wide right. Seventy-five minutes, and nobody survives."}], "files": {"video": "https://github.com/atharva-729/match-mashups/releases/download/media-v1/nfl_car_cin_drama_60_video.mp4", "game": "https://github.com/atharva-729/match-mashups/releases/download/media-v1/nfl_car_cin_drama_60_game.m4a", "song": "https://github.com/atharva-729/match-mashups/releases/download/media-v1/nfl_car_cin_drama_60_song.m4a"}, "story": "Two teams keep rising from the dead for 75 minutes. Then the last kick drifts wide.", "story_title": "No survivors", "why_song": "Danse Macabre: at midnight Death plays and the dead rise to dance. This game kept rising from the dead too. Every time one side was buried, it clawed back out. And when the dance ended, nobody was left standing.", "curve": [0.0, 0.076, 0.179, 0.28, 0.358, 0.403, 0.417, 0.413, 0.415, 0.441, 0.491, 0.55, 0.598, 0.618, 0.604, 0.559, 0.49